== Trivia ==
* There are unused graphics for Half Soul Hearts and Half Black Hearts that are never seen in-game.
** {{dlc|a+}} Half Soul Hearts were eventually added to the game as an unlockable.
* {{dlc|a+}} [[Booster Pack#5]] made Scared Hearts beat faster, making them slightly easier to spot. This was from [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1173905740 this Steam Workshop mod] by piber20.
* {{dlc|a+}} Gold Hearts' appearance was changed in [[Booster Pack#5]].
* Most [[item]]s that grant Black Hearts upon being picked up say "evil up" in their description.
* [[Cut Content#Cut Pickups|Immortal Hearts]] were a heart type present in the original ''Antibirth'' mod, but were not added to ''Repentance''.
* Blended hearts were a feature in the Community remix mod for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|Gold Hearts actually simply compare Isaac's current heart count to what he had on the previous frame, leading to two bugs. Firstly, it's possible for a Gold Heart to burst when health other than the rightmost heart is lost, such as using up Red Hearts with a {{m|Blood Donation Machine}}. {{dlc|nr}} Secondly, the "previous frame hearts" value is updated incorrectly; a Gold Heart bursts immediately upon pickup if Isaac had and lost a Gold Heart earlier, and his current heart count is lower than after losing the previous one.}}

